# Cave rats (11-05, CIPlay shelter_atoll_rats; in a test world): two Tangaroa rats at the back of the ammo cave 
# - alive, on the floor, under the cave's rock (not on the rock over it), walking; a picture
# of them. Points as in its recipe.
island Shelter Atoll keep
offset 20.3141 8.6569
hour 12
weather Calm
at 61 100
wait 5
expect animals Tangaroa rat 2
expect animalsinside Tangaroa rat 2
# (from the sea, the beach up to the mouth; from the mouth, the mountain's sides round it - 11-06: no rock underside
# over the water, no orange and black squares on the sides)
picture rat_shelter_ammo_out 61 6 121 61 3.5 96
picture rat_shelter_ammo_side 45 7 113 60 4 93
picture rat_shelter_ammo_mouth 61 4.4 102.5 62 3.4 86
picture rat_shelter_ammo_in 63 4.6 81.5 63.5 3.3 75.5
wait 15
expect animalsmoved Tangaroa rat 1
expect animals Tangaroa rat 2
expect animalsinside Tangaroa rat 2
